1. Definitions

"Competition" means the Inter-University GenAI Hackathon for SDGs.

"Team" means the group entered in the Competition under the name "SiMetropolis", and "Team member" means a natural person who is a member of that group.

"Judge" means a natural person appointed to judge entries in the Competition, while and only to the extent that person is acting in that capacity with respect to the Team's entry.

"Authorized User" means a Team member or a Judge.

"Licensor" means the SiMetropolis team.

"Software" means the original work known as the Northern Metropolis Decision Sandbox, including its source code, scripts, documentation, configuration, models, and original assets, in whatever form they are made available together with this License. "Software" does not include Third-Party Components.

"Third-Party Component" means a component supplied with its own license notice. The Three.js library in sandbox/web/vendor/, and the notice in sandbox/web/vendor/THREE-LICENSE.txt, are Third-Party Components.

"License" means this SiMetropolis Decision Sandbox Restricted License, Version 1.0.

